# Compressed circular-unit matrix data for exponent 691

The uploaded `344 × 344` matrix at `q = 11057` is generated by a single
phase function on the cyclic real residue group of order `345`. In cyclic
coordinates its entries are

`M(r,s) = symbolPhase (r+s) - symbolPhase r`.

The two 345-value phase vectors replace a dense matrix inverse. The row and
column permutations retain the package's original embedding/unit order.

